{"title":"Facts about Norway","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/924551075/0/marginalrevolution~Facts-about-Norway.html","date":1757369955000,"content":"<blockquote><p>But some worry that a “Norwegian disease” is developing through the use of an ever-increasing withdrawal from the fund each year. That amount — which reached NKr542bn ($54bn) this year — amounts to about a quarter of the government budget.</p>\r\n<p>This year, it helped Norway boost contributions to Ukraine without having to cut spending elsewhere or raise taxes.</p>\r\n<p>Spending on sickness and disability is the highest in the OECD group of rich countries, and four times the average. High-school dropout rates are well above the European average. Meanwhile, productivity growth has slowed, worrying policymakers.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/05b9f4e2-2fac-4f08-becc-d2c8c40a254c\" target=\"_blank\">more from Richard Milne in the FT</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/facts-about-norway.html\">Facts about Norway</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/924551075/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/924551075/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/924551075/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/924551075/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/924551075/marginalrevolution\"><img hei